Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were all surprised to learn there\Nwas a new digi-egg in an oil platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.78,0:01:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before we could get it out,\NMegadramon trapped us underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.38,0:01:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The escape pod only held one person,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we wanted Cody to go for help\Nbecause he was afraid of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.62,0:01:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't want to leave us, but\Nwe didn't give him a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.44,0:01:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had just found the digi-egg reliability
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when Whamon came to our\Nrescue with Cody and Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody lifted the Digi-Egg, and\NArmadimon Digivolved to Submarimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and Akakuma certainly\Ntaught MegaSeadramon a lesson!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.56,0:02:09.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,0)\fscx150\fscy150\pos(316,328)}Odaiba Memorial
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.52,0:02:13.48,Date,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\pos(315,373)\c&HF4F3DB&}July 30th
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.26,0:02:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.48,0:02:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.39,0:02:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My new TV show when parakeets\Nattack will be a smash hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you check the camera\Nbefore you filmed this footage?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.18,0:02:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'm a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.12,0:02:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then what the heck is that shadow?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.60,0:02:52.48,Date Shadow,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(325,369)\c&HF2F5F2&}July 31st
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.66,0:02:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for a snack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:03:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all you can think about? Food?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Traveling to and from the digital\Nworld can work up quite an appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.07,0:03:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We deserve to celebrate for our latest\Nvictory over the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard there's a rad new\Nplace down by the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get a large!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.24,0:03:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Half anchovies, half mustard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, what's the matter? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just not sure it's\Ntime to celebrate when
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we don't know what the\NDigimon Emperor is up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Cody's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should probably hold\Noff on the pizza until
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can figure out our next plan of attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.26,0:03:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, TK, you know we can't\Nfight him on an empty stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But starting tomorrow, we won't\Nbe able to use this classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.96,0:03:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The detention room has\Nbeen moved here and all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the baggage will be put\Nin the computer lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're not all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can we go tomorrow if we can't\Naccess the computer lab? Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't go into the digital\Nworld tomorrow anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot we have\Nbig plans. What plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He means plans with me, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you two talking about a date together?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.66,0:04:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.36,0:04:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys have a date to do fractions?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Davis, that's a date, not a fraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.76,0:04:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow marks the anniversary of when\Nthe Digidestined defeated Myotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.76,0:04:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis thought it was a fraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how should I know they\Nstarted putting math in calendars?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Davis, do you\Nwant to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.02,0:04:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your date?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's not a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you promise, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.24,0:04:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's already been four\Nyears since we went into the digital world.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.54,0:04:37.29,Date Shadow,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\an5\fscx115\fscy115\t(\fscx106\fscy106)\move(314,327,314,322,0,2444)\c&HEAF0E5&}August 1st
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine being in summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,camp one second, then in\Nanother dimension the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.18,0:04:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sure beats canoeing\Nand archery any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was sick, so I missed camp that summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.50,0:04:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't there the first\Ntime we saw all the weird stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys look pretty\Nweird to us, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.16,0:04:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Tai and the whole gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy anniversary, guys. Hey! Meany! Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.94,0:05:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been a long time since\Nwe've all been together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.00,0:05:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's enough of us here to\Nstart our own soccer league.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you see, not all the corrupted\NDigimon we encountered were in fact bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were just under the\Ninfluence of the evil Black Gears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we found out we could\Ndestroy the Black Gears
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with our Digivices and\Nfree them from their spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They became good friends and eventually\Nhelped us defeat the four Dark Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, those Dark Masters\Nsound like my math teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should make a\Nmovie out of this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.06,0:05:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope these grass stains will come out of\Nmy clothes or else my mom will ground me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys have to stick\Ntogether, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember that friendship is\Nthe key or you'll all be toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is absolutely impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've watched this stupid tape 50 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:06:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and every time that shadow does something\Ncompletely different, I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this was my first time as a director.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look at those monitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, it's not just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That creepy shadow is on every\Nprogram on this TV station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you've checked for\Ntechnical difficulties?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't technical, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what is it, smart guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to\Ntell my boss that I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.84,0:06:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get my show on the air because of a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll can me for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have listened to my mother\Nand gone to accounting school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an incredible story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a little afraid we\Ncan't live up to the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.62,0:06:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,achievements of you original Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't be here if\Nwe couldn't handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.91,0:06:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to fight right here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, you're so brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take no prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can the rest of you handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just follow Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't been here in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Including the smell of your socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just finished cleaning the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.12,0:07:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long have these been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.84,0:07:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit nitpicking, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad's been putting in a lot\Nof hours at the TV station.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.32,0:07:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I've been rehearsing with my band.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.28,0:07:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.70,0:07:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just you two guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.56,0:07:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, this place does\Nhave a distinct odor to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those dishes are so filthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'd rather face the Dark\NMasters again than clean them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Mom lived with me, she'd\Nnever let this mess happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.84,0:07:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She always kept us in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she cracks the whip on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.58,0:07:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't expect anything fancy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.98,0:07:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because we haven't gone grocery\Nshopping in quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.08,0:07:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but I warned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.75,0:07:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take a little stroll over to our old
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,refrigerator and take a\Npeek at what's not expired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just order a pizza?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea. A real hot one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, call 911 or the Boyson Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat at your own risk, but\Nyou said you were hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.66,0:08:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a secret, but I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little bit of hot\Nsauce, a little wasabi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a mystery meat I found in the\Nrefrigerator covered in green fuzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I never thought cooking\Ncould make you feel dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Dad must be home. Hey,\NDad. Hey, TK. Hey, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another tough day at the TV station?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always tough, but\Nlately it's been just brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.04,0:08:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:08:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even know how to explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Otismund destroyed the station again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least then, I would have\Nan answer for what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My staff is quitting every hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,saying they're seeing strange\Nthings, and I don't blame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must be losing my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening, Dad? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One second, you're walking down the hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.32,0:09:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you see something moving\Nout of the corner of your eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound too\Ncrazy so far. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when you turn to look, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a trace of anyone or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just an empty hallway. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.06,0:09:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might sound crazy, but\NI've come to a conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.14,0:09:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The station is haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.02,0:09:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're not just overtired?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.92,0:09:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have been putting in\Na lot of hours lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For instance, there's this dark shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.38,0:09:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It keeps appearing on every\Nmonitor in the station,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's different every single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it's just the equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It probably needs to be cleaned. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.98,0:09:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:09:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's pretty weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it is stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll go on a vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the Arctic is\Na nice place to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't taken one in 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with the CD player?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a soothing recording of\Nbuffaloes migrating. Buffalo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.18,0:10:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard these\Nrecordings help with stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.90,0:10:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, I'm\Nwilling to try anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a happy little buffalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You flipped your lid. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mind him, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.18,0:10:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just not a happy little buffalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.16,0:10:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, am I hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call the fire department!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.62,0:10:52.67,Date Shadow,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fscx90\fscy90\pos(316,360)}August 2nd{\c&HF6F9EC&}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.26,0:10:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the moment of\Ntruth. So far so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.26,0:11:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look boss we're never gonna finish at\Nthis rate we're definitely gonna need
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more time are you crazy this is supposed\Nto go on the air tomorrow oh that's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just great! What are we gonna do? Oh,\Nmy career is finished! Forever be known!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.06,0:11:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as the haunted director we got the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soundtrack back but it's weird this is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.18,0:11:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the very worst day of my entire life\Nwhat do you mean by weird play the darn
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take here goes hey
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.58,0:11:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait i don't hear
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything where's the music that's the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing we recorded this music but it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plays back this voice I didn't sign up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for this it's the ghost it doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sound happy and I bet it's coming for us
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.22,0:12:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, we need you right\Naway! The shadow! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.00,0:12:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no not again hey it's tokyo tower i did my
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.04,0:12:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first fashion shoot here this place looks
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,better than the last\Ntime i saw it is it true
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that a digimon leveled\Nit yep and he almost
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,demolished the entire city too why did he
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.06,0:12:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to destroy the tower why Why couldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he have blasted my\Ndentist's office instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that, students,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is how we determine how fast the pie was\Nmoving when it hit the clown in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.40,0:12:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let the bell ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please get me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.64,0:12:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mall's crowded, just like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This anniversary's making me\Nthink about the Digimon we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everywhere I look today,\NI'm seeing their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.14,0:13:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure are lots of good memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom won't be home for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.68,0:13:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's had a cooking with fungus class.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, while she's gone, I thought\Nwe could do an experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.52,0:13:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.43,0:13:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of experiment?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.44,0:13:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.35,0:13:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to do with the digiport.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiport?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.67,0:13:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how are we supposed to\Ndo an experiment from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.86,0:13:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.77,0:13:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We always have to use the\Ncomputers in the school's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.58,0:13:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,computer lab to travel to\Nand from the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if we could program\Nour D3 digivices to be
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.84,0:13:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,able to open the digiport\Nfrom our home computers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.16,0:13:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.07,0:13:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but that's easier\Nsaid than done, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do we begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, that's where it gets a little foggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a couple of theories,\Nbut I'm not real sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Izzy. Let's hear\Nthem. Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.58,0:13:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've always just assumed the power of the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,computer is the key to\Nopening the digiport.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My theory is that the\Ncomputers are incidental and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:14:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that the D3s are the true\Npower of the digiport.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These things?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.62,0:14:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've suspected it for some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I didn't say anything because I didn't\Nhave enough proof to be absolutely sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.13,0:14:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the school's computer\Nlab being used for
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.30,0:14:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,detention and our access to\Nthe DigiPort being limited,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Digimon Emperor might\Ndo some damage while
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're stuck looking for a\Nway into the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a really good point, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but where exactly are we\Nsupposed to open the DigiPort?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll open it up right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.93,0:14:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to my theory, the D3 is\Nall we'll need to open the portal,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I'm wrong, it could be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, who's the first guinea pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Davis, give it a\Ntry. What? Who, me? No, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He means the other boy with goggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.31,0:14:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiport, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.64,0:14:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.86,0:14:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.18,0:14:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:15:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to test the digiport.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.26,0:15:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.14,0:15:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Visitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better make fungus cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, we can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.44,0:15:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom's home early.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She saw our shoes by the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she comes up here and\Nwe're gone, we're toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.98,0:15:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.89,0:15:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see my theory through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll get your chance soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wish we would have\Nknown about this earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.96,0:15:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might have saved us some\Nclose calls with our parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.48,0:15:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.64,0:15:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have said something sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.32,0:15:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.18,0:15:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we know that the D3 can open\Nthe portal from any one of our homes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're going to have to be\Nextra especially careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kids. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Mom. Hi, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.94,0:15:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope everyone's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of just that, Kari,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keeping this secret from our\Nfamilies becomes a lot more
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.40,0:16:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,difficult when they can\Nbarge in on us at any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.28,0:16:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine if our mother came into our\Nrooms in the night and we weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.20,0:16:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'd probably call the\NNational Guard and the Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.84,0:16:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just going to have to\Nwork out some sort of a plan.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.78,0:16:16.70,Date Shadow,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\c&HEEF1E3&\pos(320,363)}August 3rd
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that huge cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see how it just\Ncame out of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.24,0:16:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those weathermen are always wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.06,0:16:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something here's not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.18,0:16:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.64,0:16:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:16:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bottle line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.74,0:17:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.66,0:17:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you going to call?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.86,0:17:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wants me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.76,0:17:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.70,0:17:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, I think she flipped your lid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nick. Oh, no! Let's do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.76,0:17:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you guys sure this is a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a safe Gazimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.70,0:17:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gummy Vee-mon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vee-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upamon Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.40,0:17:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poromon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume that the servant of the\NDigimon Emperor sent you to frighten us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't stand a ghost of a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.90,0:18:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.66,0:18:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't move, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.60,0:18:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon, run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.76,0:18:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.12,0:18:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tailmon, Tailmon, I'm glad you've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.34,0:18:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.78,0:18:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure hope so!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.74,0:18:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon, it's good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.76,0:18:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to tell you something, Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, old friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.80,0:18:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your great enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot beat him as you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:18:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:19:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he mean the Digimon Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your enemy is not only\Nthe Digimon Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a much greater darkness. The darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.60,0:19:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it cannot be defeated with\Nstrength alone You must
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.76,0:19:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,return the one wrapped in\Ndarkness to his true self
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? True self?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kindness will release the\Ngolden radiance Kindness?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.04,0:19:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he doesn't mean we have to be nice\Nto Ken Kindness alone will not prevail,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.70,0:19:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.61,0:19:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The golden radiance is also necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.46,0:19:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.56,0:19:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.82,0:19:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon, be careful. Wizardmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.84,0:19:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.22,0:19:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon! Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, Tailmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He came back to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who was Wizardmon, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.62,0:20:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were battling a very evil Dark\NDigimon named Myotismon. He was about to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy Kari and Godelmon. Wizardmon\Nstepped in the way of Myotismon's attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he paid the ultimate price.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.04,0:20:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wizardmon sacrificed himself\Nin order to save Kari. And
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Godelmon. And they'll never forget\Nhim for it. Will we ever see
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.78,0:20:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him again i'm sure we will\Nkari that wizard man what a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friend even from beyond he\Nstill continues to watch over me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is the significance\Nof the golden radiance
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.72,0:21:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,find out on the next\Ndigimon digital monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.54,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.69,0:21:34.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.07,0:21:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.36,0:21:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't understand it. I'm so\Nsorry. It's like a sound. It's
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.77,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.72,0:21:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost like a sound. I feel like
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.77,0:21:46.79,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.12,0:21:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A feeling I'm feeling, I'm feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:52.58,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.58,0:21:58.35,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.35,0:22:04.30,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.30,0:22:10.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.24,0:22:19.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.70,0:22:29.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.46,0:22:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.51,0:22:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are ready to go to the digital world!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.00,0:22:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The long journey is going\Nto start the long journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.62,0:22:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the next episode, Digimon Adventure 02!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.51,0:22:58.48,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx110\fscy110\pos(321,315)}Track Down the Kaiser's Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.40,0:22:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the gates are open!

